        "acfe_flexible_layout_title": "Text",
        "text_editor": "<h2>Innovation Day, an annual O3 event, is scheduled for May 8. Join our experts as we showcase real-world applications of AI.</h2>\n<p>We are excited to align 2023 Innovation Day with Philly Tech Week. You won’t want to miss this immersive and interactive experience exploring the power of ChatGPT, the cutting-edge AI language technology. Through hands-on activities, you&#8217;ll gain a deeper understanding of how AI language technology can revolutionize the way we communicate and interact with machines.</p>\n<h3>Agenda</h3>\n<h4><strong>9:30 AM ET</strong></h4>\n<p>O3 CEO, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?fetchDeterministicClustersOnly=false&amp;heroEntityKey=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_profile%3AACoAAAAc760BkOk97AghS3omhUdGCPPYZXJq0qs&amp;keywords=michael%20d.%20soileau&amp;origin=RICH_QUERY_SUGGESTION&amp;position=1&amp;searchId=a86a3329-2e40-4ac0-80f9-4fbaac1ab2b8&amp;sid=I%40z\">Michael Soileau</a> to kick off 2023 Innovation Day</p>\n<h4><strong>9:35 AM ET</strong></h4>\n<p>AI Tools for Product Design and Development: presented by <a href=\"https://www.delve.com/\">Delve</a></p>\n<p>Industrial Design: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/thomas-murray-b186214/\">Thomas Murray</a></p>\n<p>Mechanical Engineering: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/aaronpavkov/\">Aaron Pavkov</a></p>\n<p>Electrical Engineering: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/danielbrotman/\">Daniel S. Brotman</a></p>\n<h4><strong>10:10 AM ET</strong></h4>\n<p>Future of Writing Healthcare Content with AI: presented by Grafi AI (<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sean-sodha/\">Sean Sodha</a>)</p>\n<h4><strong>10:40 AM ET</strong></h4>\n<p>Keynote O3 presentation: Conversing with the Future: An interactive ChatGPT Experience (<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/michaelgadsby/\">Mike Gadsby</a> and <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?fetchDeterministicClustersOnly=false&amp;heroEntityKey=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_profile%3AACoAACWc5c0B9O3QunEiC8EPmvvzCicLW7UxV9g&amp;keywords=josh%20friedman&amp;origin=RICH_QUERY_TYPEAHEAD_HISTORY&amp;position=0&amp;searchId=be477950-94e5-4059-891b-dc5494d0ca37&amp;sid=J%3A_\">Josh Friedman</a>)</p>\n<h3>Date</h3>\n<p>May 8, 2023</p>\n<h3>Time</h3>\n<p>9:30 &#8211; 11:30 AM ET</p>\n<h3>Location</h3>\n<p>1339 Frankford Ave, Suite 3<br />\nPhiladelphia, PA 19125</p>\n<h3>Parking</h3>\n<p>Street parking in Fishtown can be limited. A public parking lot is located just two blocks from O3 headquarters at 1334 N Front St, Philadelphia, PA 19122.</p>\n"
